                        "entry_id": "29f02fda-ef23-3c6f-8499-619f7ccd34c2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "quirk, quirkiness, peculiarity (usually of a personality)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial",
                            "inanimate",
                            "masculine"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "990814cc-428c-48d4-b5be-50c5c5cdfcda",
                                "sense_id": "35b34992-7cd2-3c19-b584-1f9307c204be",
                                "text": "с бзи́ком",
                                "translation": "quirky, peculiar",
                                "english": "quirky, peculiar"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8bf908f-2abe-4416-9c9e-8098bdeb75dc",
                                "sense_id": "35b34992-7cd2-3c19-b584-1f9307c204be",
                                "text": "― Почти не продает своих картин, бзик такой…",
                                "translation": "“He almost never sells his paintings; that's his quirk.”",
                                "english": "“He almost never sells his paintings; that's his quirk.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d8179e6c-2735-35ce-95d2-00c3d91066ce",
                        "entry_id": "29f02fda-ef23-3c6f-8499-619f7ccd34c2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "obsession, mania (an illogical, inexplicable interest or wish)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial",
                            "inanimate",
                            "masculine"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b06e5abb-3194-47a9-ae8a-04249a6bf699",
                                "sense_id": "d8179e6c-2735-35ce-95d2-00c3d91066ce",
                                "text": "Что за бзик на оленей был в семидесятые и начале восьмидесятых, когда, предположительно, эта кофта была связана ― Петров не понимал […]",
                                "translation": "Petrov did not understand the reindeer mania of the seventies and early eighties when this jacket had presumably been knitted […]",
                                "english": "Petrov did not understand the reindeer mania of the seventies and early eighties when this jacket had presumably been knitted […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
